ute+Boy+%26+Mellow+%26+Sleazy%29", "search": true}, {"label": "spotify", "url": "https://open.spotify.com/search/Officixl+RSA%2C+Lowbass+Djy+%26+Ndibo+Ndibs+Shokozela+%28feat.+Matute+Boy+%26+Mellow+%26+Sleazy%29", "search": true}, {"label": "apple", "url": "https://music.apple.com/au/song/6778014443", "search": false}, {"label": "deezer", "url": "https://www.deezer.com/search/Officixl+RSA%2C+Lowbass+Djy+%26+Ndibo+Ndibs+Shokozela+%28feat.+Matute+Boy+%26+Mellow+%26+Sleazy%29", "search": true}, {"label": "discogs", "url": "https://www.discogs.com/search/?q=Officixl+RSA%2C+Lowbass+Djy+%26+Ndibo+Ndibs+Shokozela+%28feat.+Matute+Boy+%26+Mellow+%26+Sleazy%29&type=all", "search": true}], "notes": ["2026 CLAVA ENTERTAINMENT"]}], "counts": {"high": 2, "mid": 11, "low": 2}, "transcripts": [{"start": "00:12:40", "end": "00:15:09", "text": "You are tuned in to The Honour Show on FBi Radio 94.5. I hope everyone is having a great Saturday and I am so happy to be here as per usual. Don't really know what direction I'm feeling like going in today. I have come off the back of a very deep dive into Deep House and I've just really been enjoying my time there. So who knows we could end up there. two weeks ago i had actually it was last weekend had the pleasure of playing an extended deep house set for africaleidoscope's event and i had the best time my friends were there we had a ball i think it was something so different and something that i resonate with so much just in terms of djing the southern african house scene and everything to do with that so definitely had a good time and can't wait to do it again but this song here is called sad generation by mdu aka trp and if anyone knows who that is it's probably one of the biggest pioneers of the sound the ama piano sound at least he brought the log drum to the whole sound which is what the genre is characterized by and this song at the moment is blowing up on socials and if you're on the tiktoks the instagrams the twitters even you would have seen some viral videos from a guy his name is scruff28 he's not even a guy he's a producer a great producer he's been around for a long time definitely under the radar i would say and there's just been so many memes i think because he's so nonchalant when he plays and the things he was doing while he was playing have just been clipped so much and have just become such great memes and a lot of DJs are sort of recreating that and it's so nice to see a good producer also get his flowers now though it's taken some time but I guess in due time things like that happen to the right people so he's also released an album off the back of that success which I think is a good idea but might play a couple of his singles see what's been going off lately in the scene in this space we've got the whole hour together let me know what you've been listening to on 0435 123 945 stay tuned"}, {"start": "00:47:28", "end": "00:49:52", "text": "You are tuned into The Arnold Show on FBi Radio 94.5 and somehow we're left with just over 10 minutes for this week's show but before I do leave everybody, I did have just a couple of things to say about what's going on in the next couple of weeks, what I've been listening to and just things I think everyone should know really. but tonight there is a boat party that's being hosted by waza uk and anyone that does know they're probably one of the biggest amapiano events that are coming out of the uk and they're doing a australia tour so last night they were in perth today they're in sydney i think tomorrow is melbourne and it looked live in perth personally i have to say and i'm interested to see how the boat party is gonna go here the lineup is pretty stacked with some really good local djs that we do have and i'm really happy to see a lot of my own friends and just a lot of other djs that are being showcased in this space as well i think it's something that we are so deserving of and it's nice to see and i'm so happy to go out and support them so if you are free i mean it is in like two hours so i'd say get that ticket you'll find me there you'll find my best friend there we are excited just to go have a good time with that also being said there is a lot of new music that's coming out in the last couple days weeks and I think it's because of December being so close by and this is usually the time where producers vocalists artists are pushing their music to the max I'm interested to see what the biggest hits of December are going to be I think there are some that are standing out already that I'm very happy to share over the next couple of weeks as we enter the December holiday period but I'll see what I close out with for this week probably some of the tracks I've been listening to and I think that'll be some of December's biggest I think I've got a couple of them saved on my USB so I think that's what we'll close out with this week but thank you all for staying tuned have a safe lovely weekend I'll be back here same time same place for the same vibes this was the yana show"}], "fbi_json": [{"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:00:45"}, "track": {"title": "Dance With Me (feat. Ruby Gold) [Dub Feel]", "artists": [{"name": "Mbuso De Mbazo & Lowbass Djy"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:06:00"}, "track": {"title": "God Have Mercy", "artists": [{"name": "Tshepo Macucwa"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:07:00"}, "track": {"title": "Endaweni (feat. Lil barbs & Didamodak)", "artists": [{"name": "Abuti kshoz & S.O Oddfella"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:09:50"}, "track": {"title": "Sad Generation (feat. Smavesh)", "artists": [{"name": "MDU aka TRP"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "high"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:16:00"}, "track": {"title": "uMoya 2.0 (feat. Soulful Disciple) [Tyc